; print_end - forwarding file for the slicer end G-code.
; 3.7 renamed it to sys/meltingplot/print/finish.g; the slicer end G-code and every
; file sliced before 3.7 still call this path. Kept, and silent for now - it becomes
; DEPRECATED with RRF 3.8 (then it warns with M118 P0 L1) so the slicer profiles can be
; moved to M98 P"0:/sys/meltingplot/print/finish.g" first
; (CLAUDE.md, "Deprecated forwarding files").
; Nothing may follow the M98: print/finish.g ends inside the mode-downgrade window
; (CLAUDE.md, "The mode-downgrade window").

M98 P"0:/sys/meltingplot/print/finish.g"
